<script data-page="app" type="application/json">{"component":"flashcards\/study","props":{"errors":{},"name":"Topwords","auth":{"user":{"id":5,"name":"\u00c1rp\u00e1d Szaniszl\u00f3","email":"developedbybarley@gmail.com","email_verified_at":null},"isAdmin":true,"subscription":{"plan":"premium","hasActiveAccess":true,"isSubscribed":false,"isPremium":true,"hasAiAccess":true,"isOnTrial":false}},"sidebarOpen":true,"billingEnabled":false,"flash":{"streakTriggered":null,"success":null,"error":null,"info":null,"achievements":[],"calibrationPrompt":null,"showTour":false,"importedCardId":null},"deck":{"id":34,"name":"April"},"cards":[{"id":51452,"front":"<p>After a stressful week, a short weekend _______ to the countryside was exactly what I needed. <em>(r\u00f6vid utaz\u00e1s \/ kikapcsol\u00f3d\u00e1s)<\/em><\/p><p>The couple planned a romantic _______ to a secluded island for their anniversary. <em>(romantikus kiruccan\u00e1s \/ elvonul\u00e1s)<\/em><\/p><p>The bank robbers&#039; _______ car was found abandoned a few miles from the scene. <em>(menek\u00fcl\u0151 \/ sz\u00f6k\u00e9shez haszn\u00e1lt)<\/em><\/p><p>For many, retirement marks the beginning of a long-awaited _______ from the daily grind. <em>(szabadul\u00e1s \/ menek\u00fcl\u00e9s)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">kiruccan\u00e1s \/ menek\u00fcl\u00e9s \/ sz\u00f6k\u00e9s<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): marad\u00e1s \/ otthonl\u00e9t \/ visszat\u00e9r\u00e9s<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 weekend _______ = h\u00e9tv\u00e9gi kiruccan\u00e1s (pl. We&#039;re planning a weekend _______ to the mountains.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 romantic _______ = romantikus kiruccan\u00e1s (pl. They enjoyed a romantic _______ to Paris.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 quick _______ = gyors kiruccan\u00e1s (pl. Let&#039;s have a quick _______ to the beach.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 the perfect _______ = a t\u00f6k\u00e9letes menek\u00fcl\u00e9s\/kiruccan\u00e1s (pl. This resort is the perfect _______ from city life.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a little _______ = egy kis kiruccan\u00e1s (pl. We need a little _______ from our routine.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>getaway<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>getaway<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: weekend getaway \/ romantic getaway \/ quick getaway \/ short getaway<\/span><\/p><p>similar: escape \/ break \/ vacation \/ retreat<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: stay \/ return \/ arrival<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"getaway","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"new","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":null,"reviewed_on":null,"due_at":null,"previous_state":null},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 perc","good":"10 perc","easy":"4 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-23T08:01:35+00:00"},{"id":51465,"front":"<p>The project was a complete disaster; it failed _______. <em>(teljesen \/ eg\u00e9szen)<\/em><\/p><p>Considering all the expenses, the trip cost us _______ a thousand dollars. <em>(\u00f6sszesen \/ mindent egybev\u00e9ve)<\/em><\/p><p>She wasn&#039;t sure if she liked the new design _______, but some elements were appealing. <em>(\u00e1ltal\u00e1ban v\u00e9ve \/ eg\u00e9sz\u00e9ben)<\/em><\/p><p>After the long discussion, they decided to abandon the plan _______. <em>(v\u00e9glegesen \/ teljes eg\u00e9sz\u00e9ben)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">\u00f6sszesen \/ teljesen \/ \u00e1ltal\u00e1ban v\u00e9ve<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): r\u00e9szben \/ k\u00fcl\u00f6n-k\u00fcl\u00f6n \/ egyedileg<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 not _______ = nem teljesen (pl. I&#039;m not _______ convinced.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ different = teljesen m\u00e1s (pl. The outcome was _______ different from what we expected.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ wrong = teljesen rossz (pl. Your calculations were _______ wrong.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 give up _______ = teljesen felad (pl. He decided to give up smoking _______.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>altogether<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>altogether<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: not altogether \/ altogether different \/ altogether wrong \/ altogether new<\/span><\/p><p>similar: completely \/ entirely \/ wholly \/ totally<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: partially \/ partly \/ in part<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-23","reviewed_on":"2026-06-23","due_at":"2026-06-23T13:08:50+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"new","due_at":null,"interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":null,"reviewed_on":null}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 perc","good":"10 perc","easy":"4 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-23T13:18:14+00:00"},{"id":51475,"front":"<p>Please stay in your designated _______ when driving on the highway to ensure safety. <em>(s\u00e1v \/ \u00fats\u00e1v)<\/em><\/p><p>The narrow country _______ was barely wide enough for two cars to pass. <em>(mell\u00e9k\u00fat \/ \u00f6sv\u00e9ny)<\/em><\/p><p>The swimmer pushed off the wall, trying to gain an advantage in her _______. <em>(versenys\u00e1v \/ p\u00e1lya)<\/em><\/p><p>He chose to stay in his own _______, not interfering with others&#039; affairs. <em>(s\u00e1v \/ \u00fat)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">s\u00e1v \/ \u00fat \/ p\u00e1lya<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): sz\u00e9les \u00fat \/ f\u0151\u00fat \/ ny\u00edlt t\u00e9r<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 bike _______ = ker\u00e9kp\u00e1rs\u00e1v (pl. Always use the bike _______ when cycling in the city.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 fast _______ = gyors\u00edt\u00f3s\u00e1v (pl. Drivers often speed in the fast _______ on the motorway.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 country _______ = mell\u00e9k\u00fat (pl. We drove down a winding country _______ to reach the cottage.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 swimming _______ = \u00fasz\u00f3s\u00e1v (pl. Each competitor had their own swimming _______ in the race.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 memory _______ = mem\u00f3rias\u00e1v (pl. The computer&#039;s memory _______ allows for faster data access.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>lane<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>lane<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: traffic lane \/ slow lane \/ express lane \/ bowling lane<\/span><\/p><p>similar: path \/ track \/ road \/ alley<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: main road \/ highway \/ avenue<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"new","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":null,"reviewed_on":null,"due_at":null,"previous_state":null},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 perc","good":"10 perc","easy":"4 nap"},"other_side_due_at":null},{"id":51460,"front":"<p>The student&#039;s repeated acts of _______ towards the teacher led to a serious disciplinary meeting. <em>(pimaszs\u00e1g \/ arc\u00e1tlans\u00e1g)<\/em><\/p><p>He was fired for his _______ and disrespect towards senior management during the crucial meeting. <em>(tiszteletlens\u00e9g \/ szemtelen viselked\u00e9s)<\/em><\/p><p>Despite her humble background, she never tolerated any _______ from those who thought themselves superior. <em>(g\u0151g\u00f6s viselked\u00e9s \/ lekezel\u00e9s)<\/em><\/p><p>The king, known for his strict demeanor, would not countenance such _______ from his courtiers. <em>(udvariatlans\u00e1g \/ szemtelens\u00e9g)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">arc\u00e1tlans\u00e1g \/ pimaszs\u00e1g \/ szemtelen viselked\u00e9s<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): tisztelet \/ al\u00e1zat \/ udvariass\u00e1g<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 act of _______ = arc\u00e1tlan tett (pl. His act of _______ was unforgivable.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 display _______ = arc\u00e1tlans\u00e1got mutat (pl. She displayed great _______ by interrupting the speaker.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 accused of _______ = arc\u00e1tlans\u00e1ggal v\u00e1dolva (pl. He was accused of _______ after his outburst.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 unforgivable _______ = megbocs\u00e1thatatlan arc\u00e1tlans\u00e1g (pl. Such unforgivable _______ cannot be tolerated.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>insolence<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>insolent<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>insolently<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>insolence<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: blatant insolence \/ sheer insolence \/ utter insolence \/ act of insolence<\/span><\/p><p>similar: impertinence \/ impudence \/ disrespect \/ audacity<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: deference \/ respect \/ humility<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"insolence\ninsolent\ninsolently","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-23","reviewed_on":"2026-06-23","due_at":"2026-06-23T07:52:27+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"new","due_at":null,"interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":null,"reviewed_on":null}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 perc","good":"10 perc","easy":"4 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-23T13:09:03+00:00"},{"id":51474,"front":"<p>His refusal was an _______ rejection of the proposal, leaving no room for negotiation. <em>(teljes \/ egy\u00e9rtelm\u0171)<\/em><\/p><p>She was an _______ success, achieving her goals quickly and without any major setbacks. <em>(hat\u00e1rozott \/ vitathatatlan)<\/em><\/p><p>The company issued an _______ apology for the data breach, taking full responsibility. <em>(ny\u00edlt \/ \u0151szinte)<\/em><\/p><p>He condemned the actions as _______ evil, seeing no redeeming qualities in them. <em>(tiszt\u00e1n \/ abszol\u00fat)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">teljesen \/ egy\u00e9rtelm\u0171en \/ ny\u00edltan<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): r\u00e9szben \/ burkoltan \/ k\u00e9t\u00e9rtelm\u0171en<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ rejection = teljes elutas\u00edt\u00e1s (pl. His _______ rejection of the offer surprised everyone.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ lie = ny\u00edlt hazugs\u00e1g (pl. It was an _______ lie, and everyone knew it.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ victory = egy\u00e9rtelm\u0171 gy\u0151zelem (pl. The election result was an _______ victory for the incumbent.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ condemnation = hat\u00e1rozott el\u00edt\u00e9l\u00e9s (pl. The international community issued an _______ condemnation of the attacks.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ success = teljes siker (pl. The project was an _______ success, exceeding all expectations.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>outright<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>outright<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>outright<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: outright lie \/ outright rejection \/ outright victory \/ outright condemnation<\/span><\/p><p>similar: complete \/ absolute \/ total \/ unreserved<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: partial \/ indirect \/ ambiguous<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"outright","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"new","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":null,"reviewed_on":null,"due_at":null,"previous_state":null},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 perc","good":"10 perc","easy":"4 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-23T13:19:02+00:00"},{"id":51453,"front":"<p>_______ her sister, Sarah is very quiet and prefers to read rather than socialize. <em>(ellent\u00e9tben \/ szemben)<\/em><\/p><p>The new policy, _______ previous attempts, focuses on long-term sustainable solutions. <em>(m\u00e1sk\u00e9pp mint \/ nem \u00fagy mint)<\/em><\/p><p>_______ many other species, bats are nocturnal and hunt primarily at night. <em>(ellent\u00e9tben \/ k\u00fcl\u00f6nben)<\/em><\/p><p>His latest novel is _______ anything he has written before, exploring a much darker theme. <em>(nem hasonl\u00f3an \/ nem \u00fagy mint)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">ellent\u00e9tben \/ szemben \/ m\u00e1sk\u00e9pp mint<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): hasonl\u00f3an \/ ugyan\u00fagy \/ megegyez\u0151en<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ anyone else = mindenki m\u00e1ssal ellent\u00e9tben (pl. _______ anyone else, he always arrives early.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ what you might think = ellent\u00e9tben azzal, amit gondoln\u00e1l (pl. _______ what you might think, the job is quite challenging.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ most people = a legt\u00f6bb emberrel ellent\u00e9tben (pl. _______ most people, she enjoys working on weekends.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ his usual self = nem a megszokott \u00f6nmaga (pl. He was quiet and withdrawn, _______ his usual self.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>unlike<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: unlike most \/ unlike many \/ unlike anything \/ unlike his<\/span><\/p><p>similar: different from \/ dissimilar to \/ in contrast to \/ not like<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: like \/ similar to \/ alike<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"new","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":null,"reviewed_on":null,"due_at":null,"previous_state":null},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 perc","good":"10 perc","easy":"4 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-23T13:17:40+00:00"},{"id":51491,"front":"<p>The elephant used its powerful _______ to spray water over its back. <em>(orm\u00e1ny \/ elef\u00e1ntorm\u00e1ny)<\/em><\/p><p>We packed all our holiday clothes into a large travel _______. <em>(utaz\u00f3l\u00e1da \/ b\u0151r\u00f6nd)<\/em><\/p><p>The ancient oak tree had a massive, gnarled _______. <em>(fat\u00f6rzs \/ t\u00f6rzs)<\/em><\/p><p>She opened the car _______ to retrieve her groceries. <em>(csomagtart\u00f3 \/ aut\u00f3 csomagtart\u00f3ja)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">t\u00f6rzs \/ csomagtart\u00f3 \/ l\u00e1da \/ orm\u00e1ny<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): \u00e1g \/ gy\u00f6k\u00e9r \/ lev\u00e9l<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 car _______ = aut\u00f3 csomagtart\u00f3ja (pl. I put the shopping in the car _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 tree _______ = fat\u00f6rzs (pl. The squirrel ran up the tree _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 elephant&#039;s _______ = elef\u00e1ntorm\u00e1ny (pl. An elephant uses its _______ to pick up food.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 travel _______ = utaz\u00f3l\u00e1da (pl. She bought a vintage travel _______ at the antique market.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>trunk<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>trunk<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: car trunk \/ tree trunk \/ elephant&#039;s trunk \/ travel trunk<\/span><\/p><p>similar: boot \/ chest \/ torso \/ proboscis<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: branch \/ limb \/ root<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-23","reviewed_on":"2026-06-23","due_at":"2026-06-23T13:17:19+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"new","due_at":null,"interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":null,"reviewed_on":null}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"1 nap","easy":"4 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-23T07:51:25+00:00"},{"id":51472,"front":"<p>The new software significantly enhances our team&#039;s _______ to process large datasets efficiently. <em>(k\u00e9pess\u00e9g \/ alkalmass\u00e1g)<\/em><\/p><p>Despite her young age, she demonstrated an impressive _______ for problem-solving, surprising everyone. <em>(tehets\u00e9g \/ k\u00e9pess\u00e9g)<\/em><\/p><p>The country&#039;s economic _______ to recover quickly from the recession was a testament to its robust financial policies. <em>(potenci\u00e1l \/ k\u00e9pess\u00e9g)<\/em><\/p><p>Developing a strong military _______ is crucial for national defense in an uncertain world. <em>(hadipotenci\u00e1l \/ k\u00e9pess\u00e9g)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">k\u00e9pess\u00e9g \/ alkalmass\u00e1g \/ potenci\u00e1l<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): k\u