__ that he would forget such an important meeting.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>improbable<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>improbable<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>improbably<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>improbability<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: highly improbable \/ seem improbable \/ improbable event \/ quite improbable<\/span><\/p><p>similar: unlikely \/ unbelievable \/ implausible \/ doubtful<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: probable \/ likely \/ plausible<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-23","reviewed_on":"2026-06-23","due_at":"2026-06-23T13:17:55+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"new","due_at":null,"interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":null,"reviewed_on":null}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"1 nap","easy":"4 nap"},"other_side_due_at":null},{"id":51488,"front":"enormous","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"hatalmas, \u00f3ri\u00e1si","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-23","reviewed_on":"2026-06-23","due_at":"2026-06-23T13:09:37+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"new","due_at":null,"interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":null,"reviewed_on":null}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 perc","good":"10 perc","easy":"4 nap"},"other_side_due_at":null},{"id":51476,"front":"<p>We took the _______ to get to the airport faster, avoiding the city traffic. <em>(aut\u00f3p\u00e1lya \/ gyorsforgalmi \u00fat