 pl\u00fcssj\u00e1t\u00e9k (pl. She hugged her favorite _______ bear.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>stuffed<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>stuffed<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>stuff<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: stuffed animal \/ stuffed toy \/ stuffed full \/ stuffed peppers<\/span><\/p><p>similar: filled \/ packed \/ crammed \/ satiated<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: empty \/ hollow \/ hungry<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-23","reviewed_on":"2026-06-23","due_at":"2026-06-23T13:18:09+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"new","due_at":null,"interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":null,"reviewed_on":null}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"1 nap","easy":"4 nap"},"other_side_due_at":null},{"id":51465,"front":"<p>The project was a complete disaster; it failed _______. <em>(teljesen \/ eg\u00e9szen)<\/em><\/p><p>Considering all the expenses, the trip cost us _______ a thousand dollars. <em>(\u00f6sszesen \/ mindent egybev\u00e9ve)<\/em><\/p><p>She wasn&#039;t sure if she liked the new design _______, but some elements were appealing. <em>(\u00e1ltal\u00e1ban v\u00e9ve \/ eg\u00e9sz\u00e9ben)<\/em><\/p><p>After the long discussion, they decided to abandon the plan _______. <em>(v\u00e9glegesen \/ teljes eg\u00e9sz\u00e9ben)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">\u00f6sszesen \/ teljesen \/ \u00e1ltal\u00e1ban v\u00e9ve<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): r\u00e9szben \/ k\u00fcl\u00f6n-k\u00fcl\u00f6n \/ egyedileg<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 not _______ = nem teljesen (pl. I&#039;m not _______ convinced.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ different = teljesen m\u00e1s (pl. The outcome was _______ different from what we expected.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ wrong = teljesen rossz (pl. Your calculations were _______ wrong.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 give up _______ = teljesen felad (pl. He decided to give up smoking _______.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>altogether<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>altogether<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: not altogether \/ altogether different \/ altogether wrong \/ altogether new<\/span><\/p><p>similar: completely \/ entirely \/ wholly \/ totally<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: partially \/ partly \/ in part<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-23","reviewed_on":"2026-06-23","due_at":"2026-06-23T13:18:14+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"new","due_at":null,"interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":null,"reviewed_on":null}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"1 nap","easy":"4 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-23T13:08:50+00:00"},{"id":51492,"front":"<p>To avoid the busy intersection, pedestrians should use the _______. <em>(alulj\u00e1r\u00f3 \/ gyalogos alulj\u00e1r\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p>The city council approved funding for a new road _______ to ease traffic congestion. <em>(k\u00f6z\u00fati alulj\u00e1r\u00f3 \/ \u00fattest alatti \u00e1tj\u00e1r\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p>During the heavy rain, water started to collect in the _______, making it difficult to pass. <em>(v\u00edzzel teli alulj\u00e1r\u00f3 \/ \u00e1tj\u00e1r\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p>The railway _______ allowed trains to pass beneath the main road without interruption. <em>(vas\u00fati alulj\u00e1r\u00f3 \/ vas\u00fat alatti \u00e1tj\u00e1r\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">alulj\u00e1r\u00f3 \/ \u00e1tj\u00e1r\u00f3 \/ k\u00f6z\u00fati alulj\u00e1r\u00f3<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): fel\u00fclj\u00e1r\u00f3 \/ fel\u00fclj\u00e1r\u00f3 h\u00edd \/ fel\u00fclj\u00e1r\u00f3 \u00fat<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 pedestrian _______ = gyalogos alulj\u00e1r\u00f3 (pl. Always use the pedestrian _______ to cross busy streets safely.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 road _______ = k\u00f6z\u00fati alulj\u00e1r\u00f3 (pl. The new road _______ significantly improved traffic flow.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 railway _______ = vas\u00fati alulj\u00e1r\u00f3 (pl. The railway _______ ensures trains can pass without disrupting road traffic.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 walk through the _______ = \u00e1tmegy az alulj\u00e1r\u00f3n (pl. We had to walk through the _______ to get to the other side of the station.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>underpass<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>underpass<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: pedestrian underpass \/ road underpass \/ railway underpass \/ dark underpass<\/span><\/p><p>similar: subway \/ tunnel \/ passageway \/ underground passage<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: overpass \/ flyover \/ bridge<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-23","reviewed_on":"2026-06-23","due_at":"2026-06-23T13:18:48+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"new","due_at":null,"interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":null,"reviewed_on":null}},"previews":{"again":