ugh \/ suppress feelings \/ suppress a rebellion \/ suppress dissent<\/span><\/p><p>similar: repress \/ quash \/ subdue \/ stifle<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: encourage \/ release \/ promote<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"suppress","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"new","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":null,"reviewed_on":null,"due_at":null,"previous_state":null},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 perc","good":"10 perc","easy":"4 nap"},"other_side_due_at":null},{"id":51252,"front":"<p>The children were playing with a hula _______ around their waists. <em>(karika \/ gy\u0171r\u0171)<\/em><\/p><p>The blacksmith hammered the metal into a perfect _______ for the wheel. <em>(abroncs \/ keret)<\/em><\/p><p>The astronomer observed a faint _______ of gas surrounding the distant star. <em>(gy\u0171r\u0171 \/ \u00edv)<\/em><\/p><p>She longed to escape the narrow _______ of her small town and see the world. <em>(vil\u00e1g \/ k\u00f6rnyezet)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">karika \/ gy\u0171r\u0171 \/ abroncs \/ \u00edv \/ k\u00f6r<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): egyenes \/ sz\u00f6gletes \/ t\u00f6m\u00f6r<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 hula _______ = hula karika (pl. The child spun the hula _______ with ease.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ of Saturn = a Szaturnusz gy\u0171r\u0171i (pl. The _______ of Saturn are a spectacular sight.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ of fire = t\u0171zgy\u0171r\u0171 (pl. The circus performer jumped through a _______ of fire.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ around = k\u00f6rbevesz (pl. The crowd began to _______ around the performer.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>hoop<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>hoop<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>hoop<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: hula hoop \/ hoop earrings \/ hoop skirt \/ hoop snake<\/span><\/p><p>similar: ring \/ band \/ circle \/ loop<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: straight line \/ square \/ solid<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"hoop","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":1,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":3,"lapses":1,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-04-30","reviewed_on":"2026-06-22","due_at":"2026-06-23T08:07:31+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-06-22T08:02:23+00:00","interval":1,"ease_factor":185,"repetitions":3,"lapses":1,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-04-30","reviewed_on":"2026-06-22"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"2 nap","good":"3 nap","easy":"4 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-08-14T20:08:40+00:00"},{"id":51454,"front":"<p>The special forces team was sent on a dangerous _______ mission deep behind enemy lines. <em>(felder\u00edt\u0151 k\u00fcldet\u00e9s \/ felder\u00edt\u00e9s)<\/em><\/p><p>Before making a final decision, we need to do some serious _______ on the market trends. <em>(piackutat\u00e1s \/ felm\u00e9r\u00e9s)<\/em><\/p><p>The general ordered a quick _______ of the area to assess the enemy&#039;s strength. <em>(gyors felder\u00edt\u00e9s \/ helyzetfelm\u00e9r\u00e9s)<\/em><\/p><p>Let&#039;s do a quick _______ of the situation before we proceed with the plan. <em>(gyors \u00e1ttekint\u00e9s \/ helyzet\u00e9rt\u00e9kel\u00e9s)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">felder\u00edt\u00e9s \/ felm\u00e9r\u00e9s \/ k\u00e9mked\u00e9s<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): titkol\u00f3z\u00e1s \/ elrejt\u00e9s \/ tudatlans\u00e1g<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 do some _______ = felder\u00edt\u00e9st v\u00