els threaten to _______ millions of people from their homes in coastal regions. <em>(lak\u00f3hely\u00e9r\u0151l el\u0171z \/ otthon\u00e1b\u00f3l kiszor\u00edt)<\/em><\/p><p>In physics, a submerged object will _______ a volume of fluid equal to its own volume. <em>(v\u00edzbe mer\u00fclve kiszor\u00edt \/ hely\u00e9b\u0151l kimozd\u00edt)<\/em><\/p><p>The invention of the automobile began to _______ horses as the primary mode of transportation. <em>(felv\u00e1lt \/ helyettes\u00edt)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">elmozd\u00edt \/ kisaj\u00e1t\u00edt \/ felv\u00e1lt<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): hely\u00e9n tart \/ megtart \/ meg\u0151riz<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ people = embereket elmozd\u00edt\/kisaj\u00e1t\u00edt (pl. The conflict continues to _______ people from their homes.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a population = n\u00e9pess\u00e9get kiszor\u00edt (pl. Climate change could _______ a significant portion of the population.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ water = vizet kiszor\u00edt (pl. A ship will _______ a large amount of water as it floats.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a rival = riv\u00e1list kiszor\u00edt (pl. New technology can quickly _______ a rival from the market.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>displace<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>displacement<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>displace<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: displace workers \/ displace populations \/ displace water \/ displace a competitor<\/span><\/p><p>similar: relocate \/ oust \/ remove \/ supplant<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: keep \/ retain \/ maintain<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_ste