______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to cause an _______ = t\u00falcsordul\u00e1st okoz (pl. Blocking the drain will cause an _______.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>overflow<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>overflow<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>overflow<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: overflow with \/ data overflow \/ information overflow \/ emotional overflow<\/span><\/p><p>similar: spill over \/ run over \/ flood \/ inundate<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: underflow \/ drain \/ empty<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"new","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":null,"reviewed_on":null,"due_at":null,"previous_state":null},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 perc","good":"10 perc","easy":"4 nap"},"other_side_due_at":null},{"id":51472,"front":"<p>The new software significantly enhances our team&#039;s _______ to process large datasets efficiently. <em>(k\u00e9pess\u00e9g \/ alkalmass\u00e1g)<\/em><\/p><p>Despite her young age, she demonstrated an impressive _______ for problem-solving, surprising everyone. <em>(tehets\u00e9g \/ k\u00e9pess\u00e9g)<\/em><\/p><p>The country&#039;s economic _______ to recover quickly from the recession was a testament to its robust financial policies. <em>(potenci\u00e1l \/ k\u00e9pess\u00e9g)<\/em><\/p><p>Developing a strong military _______ is crucial for national defense in an uncertain world. <em>(hadipotenci\u00e1l \/ k\u00e9pess\u00e9g)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">k\u00e9pess\u00e9g \/ alkalmass\u00e1g \/ potenci\u00e1l<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): k\u00e9ptelens\u00e9g \/ alkalmatlans\u00e1g \/ tehetetlens\u00e9g<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 human _______ = emberi k\u00e9pess\u00e9g (pl. Exploring the limits of human _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 technical _______ = technikai k\u00e9pess\u00e9g (pl. The company lacks the technical _______ to develop this product.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 develop _______ = k\u00e9pess\u00e9get fejleszt (pl. We need to develop our team&#039;s _______ in data analysis.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 demonstrate _______ = k\u00e9pess\u00e9get mutat be (pl. She demonstrated a remarkable _______ to learn new languages quickly.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 full _______ = teljes k\u00e9pess\u00e9g (pl. The system is not yet operating at its full _______.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>capability<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>capable<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>capably<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>capability<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: intellectual capability \/ operational capability \/ learning capability \/ financial capability<\/span><\/p><p>similar: ability \/ capacity \/ potential \/ aptitude<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: inability \/ incapacity \/ incompetence<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"capability","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"new","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":null,"reviewed_on":null,"due_at":null,"previous_state":null},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 perc","good":"10 perc","easy":"4 nap"},"other_side_due_at":null},{"id":51468,"front":"<p>It&#039;s easy to _______ the simple pleasures in life, like a warm cup of coffee on a cold morning. <em>(term\u00e9szetesnek vesz \/ nem \u00e9rt\u00e9kel el\u00e9gg\u00e9)<\/em><\/p><p>Many people _______ their health until they face a serious illness. <em>(nem becs\u00fcl meg \/ nem t\u00f6r\u0151dik vele)<\/em><\/p><p>The company&#039;s success was largely due to its dedicated employees, a fact the management tended to ______