00e1s \/ zokog\u00f3 hang<\/p><p>Negative meaning (HU): nevet \/ \u00f6r\u00fcl \/ csendben van<\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ (verb) = zokog, hangosan s\u00edr (r\u00f6vid, g\u00f6rcs\u00f6s hanggal)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ (noun) = zokog\u00e1s, zokog\u00f3 hang<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ one&#039;s heart out = keservesen zokog \/ kizokogja mag\u00e1t<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 hasonl\u00f3: cry = s\u00edr \/ weep = k\u00f6nnyezik (halkabb) \/ wail = jajvesz\u00e9kel<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 m\u00e1ssalhangz\u00f3 megdupl\u00e1z\u00f3dik: sob \u2192 s________bed \/ s________bing<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p>verb: sob<\/p><p>past tense \/ -ing form: sobbed \/ sobbing<\/p><p>noun: sob<\/p><p>common pair: sob quietly \/ let out a sob \/ sob one&#039;s heart out \/ uncontrollable sobbing<\/p><p>similar: cry \/ weep \/ wail \/ whimper \/ break down<\/p><p>negative: laugh \/ rejoice \/ stay silent \/ smile<\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":null,"review":{"state":"learning","interval":1,"ease_factor":215,"repetitions":3,"lapses":1,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-02","reviewed_on":"2026-06-23","due_at":"2026-06-23T07:52:05+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"relearning","due_at":"2026-06-23T07:41:56+00:00","interval":1,"ease_factor":215,"repetitions":3,"lapses":1,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-02","reviewed_on":"2026-06-23"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"1 nap","easy":"4 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-25T14:58:59+00:00"},{"id":51460,"front":"<p>The student&#039;s repeated acts of _______ towards the teacher led to a serious disciplinary meeting. <em>(pimaszs\u00e1g \/ arc\u00e1tlans\u00e1g)<\/em><\/p><p>He was fired for his _______ and disrespect towards senior management during the crucial meeting. <em>(tiszteletlens\u00e9g \/ szemtelen viselked\u00e9s)<\/em><\/p><p>Despi