anted that... = term\u00e9szetesnek vesz, hogy... (pl. He _______ that she would always be there.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 never _______ = soha ne vedd term\u00e9szetesnek (pl. Never _______ the kindness of strangers.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>take for granted<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>take for granted<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: take for granted that \/ take someone for granted \/ take something for granted \/ never take for granted<\/span><\/p><p>similar: undervalue \/ underappreciate \/ disregard \/ presume<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: appreciate \/ value \/ cherish<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-23","reviewed_on":"2026-06-23","due_at":"2026-06-23T13:16:30+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"new","due_at":null,"interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":null,"reviewed_on":null}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"1 nap","easy":"4 nap"},"other_side_due_at":null},{"id":51492,"front":"<p>To avoid the busy intersection, pedestrians should use the _______. <em>(alulj\u00e1r\u00f3 \/ gyalogos alulj\u00e1r\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p>The city council approved funding for a new road _______ to ease traffic congestion. <em>(k\u00f6z\u00fati alulj\u00e1r\u00f3 \/ \u00fattest alatti \u00e1tj\u00e1r\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p>During the heavy rain, water started to collect in the _______, making it difficult to pass. <em>(v\u00edzzel teli alulj\u00e1r\u00f3 \/ \u00e1tj\u00e1r\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p>The railway _______ allowed trains to pass beneath the main road without interruption. <em>(vas\u00fati alulj\u00e1r\u00f3 \/ vas\u00fat alatti \u00e1tj\u00e1r\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">alu